Wine win32u: keep 256 unused realized fonts and the glyph bitmaps of 256 unused fonts instead of 10 and 5, and stop reusing a cached font once a face was added or removed. The FSLabs displays cycle through 59 fonts, and the small caches made win32u realize about 790 fonts a second under its global font lock.
Applies to wine-cachyos with: patch -p1 --forward --fuzz=0 -i <this file>

diff --git a/dlls/win32u/ntgdi_private.h b/dlls/win32u/ntgdi_private.h
--- a/dlls/win32u/ntgdi_private.h
+++ b/dlls/win32u/ntgdi_private.h
@@ -271,6 +271,7 @@
     struct list            child_fonts;
     DWORD                  handle;
     DWORD                  cache_num;
+    DWORD                  generation;
     DWORD                  hash;
     UINT                   charset;
     UINT                   codepage;
